---
description: Colocate route-only code under the route directory
globs: "app/**/*.{ts,tsx},components/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# File organization

- **Route-only** components → `components/` inside that route; schemas → `schemas/`; API helpers → `api/`
  - e.g. `app/[locale]/(admin)/dashboard/gallery/components/gallery-tab.tsx`
- **Shared** across routes → root `components/` or `lib/`
- Layout-only chrome may stay next to the layout
- Rule of thumb: one route → colocate; two or more → shared location
